# Every launch, StableProjectorz will check if a new version is available.
# It will check these 2 URLS:
#
#  https://pastebin.com/raw/DP5JQ5Ja
#  https://stableprojectorz.com/latest-version
#
# But if you want to skip checking these URLs, remove the # character:

#--skip-updates-check


# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Agent bridge (optional, OFF by default)
#
# Opens a local command socket on 127.0.0.1 so an external tool - such as the
# spz-mcp server - can inspect the app and trigger actions.
# It never listens on anything but the loopback address, and every request must
# carry an access token. Leave it off unless you use it.
#
# Remove the # character to enable:

#--agent-bridge

# Optional. Default port is 8765:
#--agent-bridge-port=8765

# A token is always required. If you don't set one here, the app generates a
# random secret on first launch and stores it under your local app data folder
# (the path is printed in the log). Clients read that file, so you normally set
# nothing. Use this only to pin a secret of your own:
#--agent-bridge-token=change-me